      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "As the showcase is about to start, Paquita tells Magüi how fond she still is of Fernando and admits her pre-show nerves. Then student actress Mariona steps onstage as Hedda Gabler and instantly catches Paquita's eye. Listen to the Spanish first.",
